# PR review (follow-up)

No merge-blocking issues found, but control swapping still has one narrow dirty-state bug. Existing FieldRoot suites pass in jsdom and Chromium; an added non-null baseline regression test fails on the current head.

## Bugs (1)

### 1. 🟠 Recapture non-null baselines when swapping controls

**Location:** `packages/react/src/internals/field-register-control/useFieldControlRegistration.ts:100`

```tsx
if (validityData.initialValue === null && initialValue !== null) {
  setValidityData((prev) => ({ ...prev, initialValue }));
}
```

The new source guard permits synchronization for each swapped-in control, but this condition only replaces a `null` baseline. When the previous control had a non-null initial value, the replacement control continues comparing against that stale value.

**Failure scenario:** Swap a control with `defaultValue="a"` for one with `defaultValue="x"`, change the replacement to `y`, then return it to `x`. The field incorrectly retains `data-dirty`.

**Fix:** Update the baseline whenever the control source changes, while returning the previous state object when the value is unchanged to avoid an unnecessary render:

```diff
diff --git a/packages/react/src/internals/field-register-control/useFieldControlRegistration.ts b/packages/react/src/internals/field-register-control/useFieldControlRegistration.ts
@@
     const initialValue = getRegistrationValue(registration);

-    if (validityData.initialValue === null && initialValue !== null) {
-      setValidityData((prev) => ({ ...prev, initialValue }));
-    }
+    setValidityData((prev) => {
+      if (Object.is(prev.initialValue, initialValue)) {
+        return prev;
+      }
+
+      return { ...prev, initialValue };
+    });
```

The source guard prevents subsequent value changes from overwriting the baseline. Please also add a non-null-to-non-null control-swap regression test.

## Tests (0)

No findings.

## Simplifications (0)

No findings.

## Docs (0)

No findings.

## Verdict

**Approve after nits** - the null-initial-value fix works, but swapped controls can retain a stale non-null baseline.

---

